{"type": "say", "text": "Thank you, Elena. Before Daniel begins, I need to raise an urgent matter on the site compliance side. I received the latest independent laboratory results after our draft package was assembled, and there is a significant finding that affects the renewal submission. I have not yet circulated the lab addendum because of the timing. I think it's critical that everyone hears this before we proceed, as it impacts the compliance certification, the monitoring plan, and potentially other portions of the package. With your permission, I'd like to briefly share this finding now rather than waiting for my scheduled turn, so that Daniel and Nia can factor it into their reports as well."}
